* Awards list header
*
* Purpose:          Prints the race name and "AWARDS LIST" banner at the top
*                   of the awards report. Exclude 0 has no effect and is
*                   kept for clarity; the exclusion array is fresh at each
*                   listing run. Only Cancel Exclude clears exclusions mid-run.
*
* Parameters:       %1 = race code (e.g., 5K, 10K, HALF) for the per-distance banner.
*
* Note:             Always call this first in the awards listing file
*                   before @OVERALL.RSM and AGERES.RSM.
*
Header

.INCLUDE            RACENAME.%1

.ce ********** AWARDS LIST **************

.End of Header
No Page Numbers
No Column Headers
Exclude             0
event               %awards_event%
